Community grant (gratis): use, modify, and redistribute, provided all
distributions remain under this same license with complete corresponding
source (no closed-source products under the community grant).

Commercial license (paid): required for closed-source use. Projects with
monthly gross revenue exceeding CNY ¥1,000 that wish to use this software in
closed-source products must obtain a paid commercial license from the
copyright holder.

Copyright holder exception: the copyright holder may use this software in
closed-source / proprietary products without the open-source obligations above,
and may dual-license the software commercially.

Except for rights expressly granted herein, all rights are reserved by the
copyright holder.

